        "source": "Feetech STS3095-C002 at 12 V as listed by the OpenELAB reseller (95 kg.cm stall, 22.5 kg.cm rated, 31 rpm no load); no Feetech datasheet was found. Gear ratio 1/399 from the AM-ARM README (liyiteng/AM-ARM 5b03af1); that repository's bom.md says 1/345. Acceleration: LeRobot's FeetechMotorsBus.configure_motors writes Acceleration 254 (and Maximum_Acceleration 254 on protocol 0) to every motor at lerobot_alohamini ec65318; at 100 steps/s^2 per unit (Feetech STS register convention, 4096 steps per turn) that is 38.97 rad/s^2 at the shaft. The unit is not from a Feetech datasheet, and under load the stall torque may limit it further: estimated."
