        "source": "Feetech STS3215 (C018, 12 V, 1/345) as listed by RobotShop and OpenELAB (30 kg.cm stall, 10 kg.cm rated, 0.222 s/60 deg no load); no Feetech datasheet was found. Gear ratio from the AM-ARM README and bom.md (liyiteng/AM-ARM 5b03af1). Acceleration: LeRobot's FeetechMotorsBus.configure_motors writes Acceleration 254 (and Maximum_Acceleration 254 on protocol 0) to every motor at lerobot_alohamini ec65318; at 100 steps/s^2 per unit (Feetech STS register convention, 4096 steps per turn) that is 38.97 rad/s^2 at the shaft. The unit is not from a Feetech datasheet, and under load the stall torque may limit it further: estimated."
